# Captured page markup used as locator-contract fixtures. These are verbatim captures from a real
# rendered site, and their whole value is that nobody edited them: reflowing the HTML would break the
# guarantee, make re-capture produce noisy diffs, and let a Prettier upgrade masquerade as plugin drift.
src/projects/*/pages/__fixtures__/*.html

# Husky hook scripts (shell; Prettier has no parser for them)
.husky/

# Claude Code worktrees (`claude -w`): checkouts of other branches, formatted from inside them
.claude/worktrees/
